---
title: "invest (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: whenNotPaused
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenSaleNotEnded
    q_guard2 --> q_guard3: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard3 --> q_verifySig: _verifySignatureNotUsed(signature)
    q_verifySig --> q_validateSig: _verifyValidPosition(signature, positionId, INVEST)
    q_validateSig --> q_markSig: s_usedSignatures[msg.sender][signature] = true
    q_markSig --> q_updatePos: _updateInvestorPosition(amount)
    q_updatePos --> q_transfer: safeTransferFrom(msg.sender, address(this), amount)
    q_transfer --> q_emit: emit CapitalInvested(amount, encryptedAmountOut, msg.sender, positionId)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_verifySig
        INV-001: Signature used once per investor to prevent replay
        INV-002: sealedBid is ECIES-encrypted bid amount
    end note

    note right of q_updatePos
        INV-003: Encrypted bid stored on-chain, decryptable only after private key reveal
        INV-004: Bid privacy maintained until publishSaleResults reveals key
    end note
